; The port's library, wrapped as Seekwright: the module a test or bin/ refers
; to as [Seekwright.Model] is [lib/model.ml]. The Python tree's own src/ is not
; part of this workspace.
;
; [yojson] is the wire codec (P2). The routing core [router] (P1) is stdlib-only
; by design — not by the absence of a [libraries] field (yojson is here for
; model.ml) but by the [ocamldep] diff in test/dune, which pins the router's
; dependencies and fails runtest if it reaches for any sibling module.
(library
 (name seekwright)
 (public_name seekwright)
 (libraries yojson))
